    "roast-chicken": {
      "id": "roast-chicken",
      "title": "Roast chicken + roasted potatoes + green beans",
      "do": "Oven 425°. Pat chicken dry; salt + pepper inside and out. Roast breast-up with halved potatoes (olive oil + salt) 1¼–1½ hr, until thigh reads 165°; add green beans (olive oil + salt) for the last 15 min. Rest 15 min; carve. Optional sauce: simmer ½ cup soy sauce, juice of 2 oranges, juice of 1 lime, 1 Tbsp Dijon, 1 garlic clove, 1 tsp ground ginger and scallions ~10 min until it thickens. Cook rice for Wed; chill. Save leftover chicken.",
